    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Eras I is the first volume in Devin Townsend’s vinyl box-set series, gathering four albums from the early Devin Townsend Project era: Ki, Addicted, Deconstruction, and Ghost. Released in 2018 on Inside Out Music and HevyDevy, it presents these records as a remastered 7-LP set, with expanded packaging and liner notes, and was issued as a limited edition collection aimed at vinyl collectors.\n\nMusically, the set traces a striking arc through Townsend’s catalog, from the tense, atmospheric restraint of Ki to the brighter, more melodic punch of Addicted, then into the dense, theatrical extremity of Deconstruction and the intimate, ambient textures of Ghost. The combination of electronic elements, progressive rock ambition, and heavy guitar work reflects one of the most distinctive phases of Townsend’s career, and the box set has been valued for consolidating a key chapter of his catalog in an audiophile-friendly format.",
